[h2]Build 0.9.59[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Burners take Vanilla Recycling Expanded's recycled wastepacks:[/b] [b]reactive chempacks[/b] (worth 4 trashbricks; x4 toxic gas, x1.5 ground pollution) and [b]volatile toxpacks[/b] (worth half a trashbrick; x20 toxic gas, x0.5 ground pollution). A way to get rid of them - just pipe the exhaust somewhere safe.
[*]Both are allowed on every burner's fuel bill by default, existing burners included, and the fuel hopper holds them.
[/list]
